%% Phase5 / CHAIN / CHAIN-COM-G02 编辑并发布
%% 机器真源: phase5.manifest.json；post_chain_update_draft/publish；im:post_chain:draft/publish
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as MessageChainContentComponent
  participant F as ChainFacadeService
  participant T as Tauri bridge
  participant H as Helix Tick / chain
  participant G as Go post-chain handlers
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as ChainProjectionStore
  UI->>F: updateDraft(chainId,expectedRevision,title,description,deadlineAt,clientMutationId,operationId,deviceId)
  F->>T: im_post_chain_update_draft
  T->>H: Tick::Command(post_chain_update_draft)
  H->>G: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/post-chain/update-draft
  G->>PG: UPDATE chain / INSERT chain_mutation
  G-->>H: revision DTO
  H->>DB: PersistAtomic chain_summary/chain_mutation
  DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
  H->>B: im:post_chain:draft
  UI->>F: publish(chainId,expectedRevision,deadlineAt,clientMutationId,operationId,deviceId)
  F->>T: im_post_chain_publish
  T->>H: post_chain_publish -> POST /publish
  H->>DB: PersistAtomic published summary
  DB-->>H: PersistOk
  H->>B: im:post_chain:publish
  B->>S: mutationById / chainById signals
  S-->>UI: chain-status
